SECTION 4: SANJEEVANI AI COPILOT CHATBOT (src/components/FrontPageChatWidget.tsx)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Embedded floating multi-turn Gemini chatbot grounded on site features, telemetry dataset (~100 PHCs across Tamil Nadu, Uttar Pradesh, Assam, Rajasthan), and navigation instructions.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SECTION 5: BACKEND EXPRESS GEMINI PROXY (server.ts)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Endpoints:
- POST `/api/gemini/voice-report`: Transcribes audio, extracts medicine name, stock count, bed occupancy, staff count.
- POST `/api/gemini/stock-photo`: Computer vision photo OCR for inventory registers.
- POST `/api/gemini/explain-alert`: Generates clinical stockout risk explanation and dispatch order.
- POST `/api/gemini/assist`: Multi-turn conversational chatbot grounded in control tower state summary with server-side RBAC model routing (gemini-3.1-pro-preview, gemini-3.8-flash, gemini-3.5-flash, gemini-3.1-flash-lite).
- POST `/api/gemini/scenario-brief`: Emergency disaster scenario summary.
- POST `/api/gemini/transfer-order`: Formal inter-PHC transport dispatch order generation.

